{
  "duration": 51.24,
  "match": 1.0,
  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "You're in the freezer aisle, holding the tub with the fancy foreign name.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.32,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Häagen-Dazs.",
      "start": 4.4,
      "end": 6.0,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "You'd guess it came from Denmark.",
      "start": 6.08,
      "end": 8.24,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "It came from the Bronx.",
      "start": 8.96,
      "end": 10.56,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Reuben Mattus made the name up at his kitchen table.",
      "start": 10.64,
      "end": 13.467,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "It doesn't mean anything, in any language.",
      "start": 13.493,
      "end": 16.12,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "Danish doesn't even have that dotted A.",
      "start": 16.16,
      "end": 18.56,
      "matched": "7/7"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "But he knew exactly what he was doing.",
      "start": 18.64,
      "end": 21.2,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "Because that name gets to you before the ice cream does.",
      "start": 21.28,
      "end": 24.52,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "You read it and picture somewhere cold, old and serious about cream.",
      "start": 24.56,
      "end": 29.333,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "So the tub in your hand already feels like the good stuff.",
      "start": 29.387,
      "end": 32.56,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "He made the ice cream rich.",
      "start": 32.697,
      "end": 34.36,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "The name made you expect rich.",
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 36.72,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, name it like the price you want to charge.",
      "start": 36.857,
      "end": 40.48,
      "matched": "14/14"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "Not website package.",
      "start": 40.68,
      "end": 42.293,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "The Launch Build.",
      "start": 42.347,
      "end": 43.554,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Because people read the name long before they read the price.",
      "start": 43.726,
      "end": 46.743,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose business is still called something solutions.",
      "start": 46.88,
      "end": 50.64,
      "matched": "12/12"
    }
  ],
